From: Stained Glass OS <ke7oxh@gmail.com>
Subject: [PATCH] netapi32: NetUserGetLocalGroups and NetUserGetGroups from the account database (3532)

netapi32: NetUserGetLocalGroups and NetUserGetGroups from the account database

NetUserGetLocalGroups lists the local groups an account is in (Users, plus Administrators for administrator accounts), NERR_UserNotFound for unknown accounts; NetUserGetGroups answers the one global group a computer has, None (levels 0 and 1). net user NAME uses the first. NetGroupEnum/NetGroupGetInfo stay as they were (a computer has no global groups to list).
